# License:    This program is declared by its author, Ronald Burkey, to be the
#             U.S. Public Domain, and may be freely used, modified, or
#             distributed for any purpose whatever.
# Filename:   Makefile.mingw
# Purpose:    Builds ASM101Sa.exe on Windows under MinGW-w64, MSYS2 or Cygwin,
#             where a real GNU make and a gcc-compatible compiler are present.
# Contact:    info@sandroid.org
#
# Usage:
#     mingw32-make -f Makefile.mingw
#     mingw32-make -f Makefile.mingw CC=clang
#     mingw32-make -f Makefile.mingw clean
#
# This is the ordinary Makefile with the executable renamed and the object
# suffix left alone; everything else about the build is identical, which is the
# point of keeping the sources free of platform conditionals.  Like the ordinary
# Makefile it writes ..\ASM101Sa.exe, beside ASM101S.py and ASM101S.bat.

EXE = ASM101Sa.exe

include Makefile
